WEBVTT

00:00.350 --> 00:06.062
Give a Docker container a local HTTPS hostname. Docker still starts and stops it.

00:06.512 --> 00:10.831
This service is unmanaged: devhost routes to it but never starts it.

00:11.281 --> 00:12.906
Docker starts the container.

00:14.881 --> 00:17.807
Its port is published on the host's loopback address.

00:18.257 --> 00:19.697
Start the stack.

00:20.146 --> 00:25.115
devhost starts no process. It publishes the container's HTTPS address.

00:25.565 --> 00:28.537
The container answers on its HTTPS hostname.

00:31.565 --> 00:33.330
Stopping the stack removes the route.

00:34.085 --> 00:35.710
The container is still running.

00:38.445 --> 00:40.395
Removing it is Docker's job.
